data.content:
Build succeeds. Here's what was created:

**`Components/ScreenSize.cs`** — enum with `Mobile`, `Tablet`, `Desktop` values.

**`Components/ScreenSizeProvider.razor`** — wraps child content in a `<CascadingValue>` named `"ScreenSize"`. Uses JS interop to listen for `resize` events and categorizes width into the appropriate bucket. Defaults to `Desktop` before JS runs.

**`wwwroot/screenSize.js`** — JS module that reports `window.innerWidth` on load and on every resize.

**Usage in child components:**

```razor
@code {
    [CascadingParameter(Name = "ScreenSize")]
    public ScreenSize ScreenSize { get; set; }
}
```
